    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 33,
      "title": {
        "es": "Especialistas universitarios con opiniones encontradas",
        "en": "University specialists with varied impressions"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Muchos tutores valoran la alta cualificación de los catedráticos, veterinarios y estudiantes en casos complejos de neurología y cirugía. Sin embargo, en situaciones de urgencia varios usuarios critican falta de empatía, desorganización o trato distante del personal.",
        "en": "Many clients commend the advanced knowledge of professors, resident veterinarians, and students in intricate neurological and surgical cases. However, during urgent walk-ins, several owners criticize perceived coldness, poor bedside manner, or bureaucratic inflexibility."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "waiting",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "es": "Largas esperas y gestión de urgencias",
        "en": "Prolonged waiting times in emergencies"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Varios testimonios señalan demoras notables para ser atendidos y dificultades para acceder a consultas urgentes sin cita. Algunos usuarios expresan frustración al encontrar servicios cerrados por la noche o con admisiones suspendidas temporalmente por falta de camas.",
        "en": "Several client reviews point out substantial waiting delays and difficulty obtaining urgent care without a prior appointment. Some pet owners express frustration upon finding emergency gates closed during night hours or inpatient admissions paused due to capacity limits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "es": "Dificultades telefónicas e información administrativa",
        "en": "Phone communication and administrative hurdles"
      },
      "text": {
        "es": "Las reseñas critican la dificultad para comunicarse por teléfono en horario nocturno o festivo, con líneas ocupadas o contestadores. También se reportan retrasos administrativos en la devolución de cobros y discrepancias sobre los horarios reales de servicio urgente.",
        "en": "Reviews frequently criticize difficulties reaching hospital staff by telephone during night shifts or holidays, reporting busy lines and generic recordings. Clients also recount administrative delays regarding billing refunds and conflicting details on emergency opening hours."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "es": "¿El hospital atiende urgencias las 24 horas?",
        "en": "Does the hospital provide 24-hour emergency service?"
      },
      "a": {
        "es": "Aunque en ocasiones se anuncia servicio continuo, clientes señalan que el servicio nocturno o de urgencias puede tener admisiones limitadas o requerir confirmación previa.",
        "en": "Although continuous care is cited, reviewers report that night emergency admissions may be restricted or require prior confirmation."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "es": "¿Es un hospital docente universitario?",
        "en": "Is this a university teaching hospital?"
      },
      "a": {
        "es": "Sí, pertenece a la Universidad Complutense de Madrid y cuenta con estudiantes y residentes junto a especialistas veterinarios.",
        "en": "Yes, it is part of the Complutense University of Madrid, involving veterinary students and residents alongside senior faculty."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "es": "¿Cuáles son las especialidades más destacadas?",
        "en": "What are the most notable specialties offered?"
      },
      "a": {
        "es": "Destacan sus servicios de neurología, oncología, cirugía avanzada y diagnóstico por imagen especializado.",
        "en": "The facility is recognized for neurology, oncology, advanced soft tissue surgery, and specialized imaging diagnostics."
